    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c9f6b946-3b16-4bbf-8a45-e0be90fb396b-image9.png\" /><br />From conservation of linear momentum,<br />Along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>-axis:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>10Mcos30</mtext><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mtext>2M</mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mn>45</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>M</mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>M</mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mn>45</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mn>10</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math> &hellip; (1)<br />Along <math x